  "steps": [
    "Add some oil and garlic in a pan. Saute well and add walnuts.",
    "Add your veggies and cook them on high foame for 5 mins.",
    "Add sauces and seasonings. Mix well and its ready!",
    "Grind mint, garlic and chillies into a paste.",
    "Add this paste to greek yogurt along with the seasonings and cucumber juliens.",
    "Garnish with peanuts and its ready!",
    "Prepare a marinade by mixing all the above and coat your paneer.",
